# __TITLE_TEXT__

This repository is a thin `__PROFILE__` consumer of `unaltraweb`. Site identity and language policy live in `_config.yml`; reusable layouts, styles, plugins, build logic, and authoring tools belong to the core package.

## Local workflow

```bash
make build
make serve
make test
make down
```

These commands validate and preview the site. They do not publish it.

## Agent workflow

Open this directory as the IDE workspace and read `AGENTS.md`. Use the `unaltraweb` MCP tools to inspect `site_context`, run `site_doctor` and `site_check`, build the site, and start the labelled preview. Keep durable decisions in versioned files rather than chat history.

If the selected MCP image cannot be pulled, ask the core maintainer for the published release or build the selected candidate in the `unaltraweb` factory checkout before retrying.
